ployment record: at main, `GROW_ARCHIVE_CONFIG` names the release that `DEMO_RELEASE` names, so the Grow Worker builds its archive driver. A deployment of this head gives the Grow Worker the base wiring and no archive driver. Ruling d257a67f accepts that, and AE-1 turns the archive on again. The demo Worker loses its only trust row and installs no application.\n\nSimplification: no required change. The re-export removes the duplicate definition digests that my R1 approval named.\n\nThis approval authorizes no landing, signing, packet publication, deployment or archive activation. Lending and Counter stay owed under request e3d8189b. The planner decides the landing.","body":{"artifact":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:8f38e91369a70cf4cacefda4387237ca0a153896","binding":"assigned","head":"583ed744801a23aac5c25d744478f54042ddd997","head_news_acknowledged":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0bdd411afabf70e41d3db426ba59d62758da5573\"]","implementations":"[\"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:285687d7284bef51c1b1e10b5ca83e476a4d6049\"]","review_frontier":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0bdd411afabf70e41d3db426ba59d62758da5573","review_path":"reviewguard@1","stale":"true","stale_bases":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:030c082a062f3446f4a6d5e6f4fa22680a3528bc, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0a8466b304f97f8cc8154938094f69e1f4c99d46, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0bdd411afabf70e41d3db426ba59d62758da5573, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:0f1442d499e28a5a08a27bf9d9d7d3d919211d60, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:1221145ad764d529e6ddb592840468ebe5069c22, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:1e9ca855de9877eb277f43601dde36627e818f33, git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3#git:sha1:243c1912fa8c92812d76d23bff010